    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino-Ducks Mayhem</strong> is a fast-paced bullet heaven game set in a colorful world. Players take control of a Dino Duck, as it blasts through never-ending waves of ooze monsters. Set on a quirky island slowly being overrun by sludge creatures, MAYHEM is all about surviving as long as you can while everything explodes around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7fd4b75ae7a2fd230a7d8fa58a4c2ad9.poster.avif?t=1755174629\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7fd4b75ae7a2fd230a7d8fa58a4c2ad9.webm?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7fd4b75ae7a2fd230a7d8fa58a4c2ad9.mp4?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Cute carnage: </strong>Stylized, fast-paced combat where waves of enemies keep coming. Each wave ramps up the intensity, speed, and mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/cf8ca9efebd9a08920e196edb410d80e.poster.avif?t=1755174629\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/cf8ca9efebd9a08920e196edb410d80e.webm?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/cf8ca9efebd9a08920e196edb410d80e.mp4?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Level up, power up: </strong>Gain experience, upgrade stats, and pick new weapons or items each wave.\u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/67bdad5dcef79f718af21c2e4cff4fd4.poster.avif?t=1755174629\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/67bdad5dcef79f718af21c2e4cff4fd4.webm?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/67bdad5dcef79f718af21c2e4cff4fd4.mp4?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numbers go boom: </strong>Expect to see huge damage, massive swarms, and explosive power as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino-Ducks Mayhem</strong> is a fast-paced bullet heaven game set in a colorful world. Players take control of a Dino Duck, as it blasts through never-ending waves of ooze monsters. Set on a quirky island slowly being overrun by sludge creatures, MAYHEM is all about surviving as long as you can while everything explodes around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7fd4b75ae7a2fd230a7d8fa58a4c2ad9.poster.avif?t=1755174629\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7fd4b75ae7a2fd230a7d8fa58a4c2ad9.webm?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/7fd4b75ae7a2fd230a7d8fa58a4c2ad9.mp4?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Cute carnage: </strong>Stylized, fast-paced combat where waves of enemies keep coming. Each wave ramps up the intensity, speed, and mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/cf8ca9efebd9a08920e196edb410d80e.poster.avif?t=1755174629\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/cf8ca9efebd9a08920e196edb410d80e.webm?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/cf8ca9efebd9a08920e196edb410d80e.mp4?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Level up, power up: </strong>Gain experience, upgrade stats, and pick new weapons or items each wave.\u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/67bdad5dcef79f718af21c2e4cff4fd4.poster.avif?t=1755174629\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/67bdad5dcef79f718af21c2e4cff4fd4.webm?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/67bdad5dcef79f718af21c2e4cff4fd4.mp4?t=1755174629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numbers go boom: </strong>Expect to see huge damage, massive swarms, and explosive power as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
